#: sysprep/sysprep_operation_script.ml:112
msgid ""
"The C<script> module lets you run arbitrary shell scripts or programs\n"
"against the guest.\n"
"\n"
"Note this feature requires FUSE support.  You may have to enable\n"
"this in your host, for example by adding the current user to the\n"
"C<fuse> group, or by loading a kernel module.\n"
"\n"
"Use one or more I<--script> parameters to specify scripts or programs\n"
"that will be run against the guest.\n"
"\n"
"The script or program is run with its current directory being the\n"
"guest’s root directory, so relative paths should be used.  For\n"
"example: C<rm etc/resolv.conf> in the script would remove a Linux\n"
"guest’s DNS configuration file, but C<rm /etc/resolv.conf> would\n"
"(try to) remove the host’s file.\n"
"\n"
"Normally a temporary mount point for the guest is used, but you\n"
"can choose a specific one by using the I<--scriptdir> parameter.\n"
"\n"
"B<Note:> This is different from I<--firstboot> scripts (which run\n"
"in the context of the guest when it is booting first time).\n"
"I<--script> scripts run on the host, not in the guest."
msgstr ""
"Modulis C<script> ļauj viesim palaist patvaļīgus čaulas skriptus\n"
"vai programmas.\n"
"\n"
"Ņemiet vērā, ka šim līdzeklim nepieciešams FUSE atbalsts.  Iespējams,\n"
"tas resursdatorā jāiespējo, piemēram, pievienojot pašreizējo lietotāju\n"
"grupai C<fuse> vai ielādējot kodola moduli.\n"
"\n"
"Ar vienu vai vairākiem parametriem I<--script> norādiet skriptus vai "
"programmas,\n"
"kas tiks palaistas viesim.\n"
"\n"
"Skripts vai programma tiek palaista ar pašreizējo direktoriju, kas ir\n"
"viesa saknes direktorija, tāpēc jāizmanto relatīvi ceļi.  Piemēram,\n"
"C<rm etc/resolv.conf> skriptā noņemtu Linux viesa\n"
"DNS konfigurācijas failu, bet C<rm /etc/resolv.conf>\n"
"(mēģinātu) noņemt resursdatora failu.\n"
"\n"
"Parasti tiek izmantots pagaidu viesa montēšanas punkts, bet\n"
"konkrētu var izvēlēties ar parametru I<--scriptdir>.\n"
"\n"
"B<Piezīme:> Tas atšķiras no I<--firstboot> skriptiem (kas darbojas\n"
"viesa kontekstā, kad tas tiek sāknēts pirmo reizi).\n"
"I<--script> skripti darbojas resursdatorā, nevis viesī."

#: sysprep/sysprep_operation_ssh_hostkeys.ml:36
msgid ""
"The SSH host keys are regenerated (differently) next time the guest is\n"
"booted.\n"
"\n"
"If, after cloning, the guest gets the same IP address, ssh will give\n"
"you a stark warning about the host key changing:\n"
"\n"
" @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@\n"
" @    WARNING: REMOTE HOST IDENTIFICATION HAS CHANGED!     @\n"
" @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@\n"
" IT IS POSSIBLE THAT SOMEONE IS DOING SOMETHING NASTY!"
msgstr ""
"SSH resursdatora atslēgas tiek ģenerētas no jauna (citādas), kad viesis "
"nākamreiz tiek\n"
"sāknēts.\n"
"\n"
"Ja pēc klonēšanas viesis saņem to pašu IP adresi, ssh jūs\n"
"stingri brīdinās par resursdatora atslēgas maiņu:\n"
"\n"
" @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@\n"
" @    WARNING: REMOTE HOST IDENTIFICATION HAS CHANGED!     @\n"
" @@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@@\n"
" IT IS POSSIBLE THAT SOMEONE IS DOING SOMETHING NASTY!"

#: sysprep/sysprep_operation_backup_files.ml:83
msgid ""
"The following files are removed from anywhere in the guest\n"
"filesystem:\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"On Linux and Unix operating systems, only the following filesystems\n"
"will be examined:\n"
"\n"
"%s"
msgstr ""
"No jebkuras vietas viesa failu sistēmā tiek noņemti šādi\n"
"faili:\n"
"\n"
"%s\n"
"\n"
"Linux un Unix operētājsistēmās tiks pārbaudītas tikai šādas\n"
"failu sistēmas:\n"
"\n"
"%s"

#: sysprep/sysprep_operation_fs_uuids.ml:52
msgid ""
"The fs-uuids operation is disabled by default because it does\n"
"not yet find and update all the places in the guest that use\n"
"the UUIDs.  For example C</etc/fstab> or the bootloader.\n"
"Enabling this operation is more likely than not to make your\n"
"guest unbootable.\n"
"\n"
"See: L<https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=991641>"
msgstr ""
"Darbība fs-uuids pēc noklusējuma ir atspējota, jo tā vēl\n"
"neatrod un neatjaunina visas viesa vietas, kurās tiek izmantoti\n"
"UUID.  Piemēram, C</etc/fstab> vai sāknētāju.\n"
"Šīs darbības iespējošana, visticamāk, padarīs jūsu\n"
"viesi nesāknējamu.\n"
"\n"
"Skatiet: L<https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=991641>"

#: builder/index_parser.ml:31
msgid ""
"The index file downloaded from ‘%s’ is corrupt.\n"
"You need to ask the supplier of this file to fix it and upload a fixed "
"version."
msgstr ""
"No „%s” lejupielādētais indeksa fails ir bojāts.\n"
"Lūdziet šī faila piegādātājam to izlabot un augšupielādēt izlabotu versiju."

#: sysprep/sysprep_operation_machine_id.ml:38
msgid ""
"The machine ID is usually generated from a random source during system\n"
"installation and stays constant for all subsequent boots.  Optionally,\n"
"for stateless systems it is generated during runtime at boot if it is\n"
"found to be empty."
msgstr ""
"Mašīnas ID parasti tiek ģenerēts no nejauša avota sistēmas\n"
"instalēšanas laikā un paliek nemainīgs visām turpmākajām sāknēšanām.  "
"Bezstāvokļa\n"
"sistēmās to pēc izvēles var ģenerēt darbības laikā sāknēšanā, ja\n"
"tiek konstatēts, ka tas ir tukšs."

#: sysprep/sysprep_operation_script.ml:140
msgid ""
"The mount point (an empty directory on the host) used when\n"
"the C<script> operation is enabled and one or more scripts\n"
"are specified using I<--script> parameter(s).\n"
"\n"
"B<Note:> C<SCRIPTDIR> B<must> be an absolute path.\n"
"\n"
"If I<--scriptdir> is not specified then a temporary mountpoint\n"
"will be created."
msgstr ""
"Montēšanas punkts (tukša direktorija resursdatorā), ko izmanto, kad\n"
"ir iespējota darbība C<script> un ar parametru(-iem) I<--script>\n"
"ir norādīts viens vai vairāki skripti.\n"
"\n"
"B<Piezīme:> C<SCRIPTDIR> B<jābūt> absolūtam ceļam.\n"
"\n"
"Ja I<--scriptdir> nav norādīts, tiks izveidots pagaidu montēšanas\n"
"punkts."

#: sysprep/sysprep_operation_pacct_log.ml:58
msgid ""
"The system wide process accounting will store to the pacct\n"
"log files if the process accounting is on."
msgstr ""
"Sistēmas mēroga procesu uzskaite saglabās datus pacct\n"
"žurnāla failos, ja procesu uzskaite ir ieslēgta."

#: sysprep/sysprep_operation_user_account.ml:133
msgid ""
"The user accounts to be kept in the guest.\n"
"The value of this option is a list of user names separated by comma,\n"
"where specifying an user means it is going to be kept.\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
" --keep-user-accounts mary\n"
"\n"
"would keep the user account C<mary>.\n"
"\n"
"This option can be specified multiple times."
msgstr ""
"Viesī saglabājamie lietotāju konti.\n"
"Šīs opcijas vērtība ir ar komatiem atdalīts lietotājvārdu saraksts,\n"
"kur norādītais lietotājs tiks saglabāts.\n"
"Piemēram:\n"
"\n"
" --keep-user-accounts mary\n"
"\n"
"saglabātu lietotāja kontu C<mary>.\n"
"\n"
"Šo opciju var norādīt vairākas reizes."

#: sysprep/sysprep_operation_user_account.ml:116
msgid ""
"The user accounts to be removed from the guest.\n"
"The value of this option is a list of user names separated by comma,\n"
"where specifying an user means it is going to be removed.\n"
"For example:\n"
"\n"
" --remove-user-accounts bob,eve\n"
"\n"
"would only remove the user accounts C<bob> and C<eve>.\n"
"\n"
"This option can be specified multiple times."
msgstr ""
"No viesa noņemamie lietotāju konti.\n"
"Šīs opcijas vērtība ir ar komatiem atdalīts lietotājvārdu saraksts,\n"
"kur norādītais lietotājs tiks noņemts.\n"
"Piemēram:\n"
"\n"
" --remove-user-accounts bob,eve\n"
"\n"
"noņemtu tikai lietotāju kontus C<bob> un C<eve>.\n"
"\n"
"Šo opciju var norādīt vairākas reizes."

